abstract: >-
  Browser-based educational and research platform for Diophantine equations,
  number theory and cryptography with reproducible experiments. It provides
  exact-arithmetic tools for linear Diophantine equations and systems over the
  integers (Smith and Hermite normal forms), Pell equations, continued
  fractions and lattice reduction, together with educational modules on RSA,
  Diffie-Hellman, elliptic curves, hash functions, post-quantum cryptography
  and classically simulated quantum algorithms. The cryptographic and quantum
  modules are intended for education and research, not for production security.
